OL,3,ASyrians struggle with soaring prices as
OL,4,Acrisis challenges post-Assad recovery
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe increase was the latest in a series
OL,7,Fof measures people blame for a growing
OL,8,Fcost-of-living crisis. For many
OL,9,FSyrians, life, financially, has
OL,10,Fworsened since rebels led by Sharaa
OL,11,Fousted President Bashar al-Assad,
OL,12,Fending five decades of his family's
OL,13,Fbrutal rule and more than 13 years of a
OL,14,Fdevastating civil war.
OL,16,FCatapulted to the presidency, Sharaa
OL,17,Fhas, since then, led Syria's transition
OL,18,Fand efforts to revive a broken economy
OL,19,Fafter a long period of mismanagement,
OL,20,Fisolation and conflict.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
